    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the civil practice law and rules, in relation to exempting\nparties liable for failure to obey or enforce certain orders of protection or\ntemporary orders of protection in domestic violence or domestic relations\nmatters from the provisions of article sixteen of such law, entitled \"limited\nliability of persons jointly liable\"",
    "basePrintNo": "S1868",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S1868-2019",
    "coSponsors": {
